# Every text file is LF in every working tree. The GitHub Windows runner's Git has
# core.autocrlf=true, which would turn the shell gates and the Lua files into CRLF: the server
# compares the stamped Lua with the installed copy byte for byte and check_bridge.sh compares
# header lines, so a CRLF checkout would ship CRLF Lua and report "updated" for ever.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.mcpb binary
